    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n99795" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνδράω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>do along with</i> or <i>together, help in doing</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς δρῶσι καὶ συνδρῶσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>El.</u>
					498
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				1025
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				6.64
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. τινί τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Andr.</u>
					40
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. αἷμα καὶ φόνον</span>
			<i>help in</i> bloodshed and murder, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Or.</u>
				406
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ συνδρῶν . . χρέος</span> the
				<i>joint</i> necessity, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Andr.</u>
				337
			</span></i>.</div>
